<title>USA: Struthers delays effective date of split.</title>
<headline>Struthers delays effective date of split.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Struthers Industries Inc on Thursday said due to administrative processing delays, the reverse stock split previously scheduled for January 15,  will become effective no later than close of business on January 17, 1997.</p>
<p>The reverse stock split, originally announced in June of last year was part of its revised proposed transaction with World Integrated which would merge World Integrated into Struthers.</p>
</text>
